{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55124","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游都将，并杀又重伤。\n若遇德乡神幷合（京本、辛本、川本作「神幷合将」），加临不尅又加（京本作「有嘉」）祥，降虏我军强。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}